00:10:27.961 --> 00:10:29.087
♪ Say, do you remember ♪

00:10:29.129 --> 00:10:30.506
♪ Ba de ya ♪

00:10:30.548 --> 00:10:33.175
♪ Dancing in September? ♪

00:10:33.217 --> 00:10:35.135
♪ Ba de ya ♪

00:10:35.177 --> 00:10:40.015
♪ Never was a cloudy day... ♪

00:10:41.016 --> 00:10:43.352
♪ ♪

00:10:44.395 --> 00:10:46.313
Do you want the

00:10:44.395 --> 00:10:46.313
heat on, sir?

00:10:46.355 --> 00:10:47.814
Yes, please.

00:10:47.856 --> 00:10:50.984
♪ ♪

00:11:05.749 --> 00:11:07.000
Oh, my God.

00:11:07.042 --> 00:11:08.960
How are we supposed

00:11:07.042 --> 00:11:08.960
to get across this?

00:11:09.002 --> 00:11:10.588
W-We have to walk

00:11:09.002 --> 00:11:10.588
on those ladders?

00:11:10.629 --> 00:11:13.173
Guys, be sure to look

00:11:10.629 --> 00:11:13.173
down the whole time.

00:11:13.215 --> 00:11:17.052
It's really deep

00:11:13.215 --> 00:11:17.052
and freaky and disorienting.

00:11:17.094 --> 00:11:20.598
(screaming)

00:11:20.639 --> 00:11:21.973
(thud)

00:11:22.015 --> 00:11:23.808
Peter!

00:11:22.015 --> 00:11:23.808
Oh, my God!

00:11:22.015 --> 00:11:23.808
Dad!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:27.020
It's okay! There's a huge pile

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:27.020
of dead bodies down here

00:11:27.062 --> 00:11:28.230
that cushioned my fall!

00:11:28.272 --> 00:11:29.981
Do any of them seem

00:11:28.272 --> 00:11:29.981
like they have

00:11:30.023 --> 00:11:32.150
any extra tampons

00:11:30.023 --> 00:11:32.150
in their backpack?

00:11:32.192 --> 00:11:33.985
Uh, no!

00:11:34.027 --> 00:11:36.238
"No," like you checked

00:11:34.027 --> 00:11:36.238
and there aren't any, "no"?

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.782
Or "no," you're

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.782
just assuming?

00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:40.618
I-I'm embarrassed.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.831
(shuddering)

00:11:46.873 --> 00:11:49.000
Peter, you left

00:11:46.873 --> 00:11:49.000
the flap open.

00:11:49.042 --> 00:11:51.044
It's like a thousand

00:11:49.042 --> 00:11:51.044
degrees in here, Lois.

00:11:51.086 --> 00:11:53.213
Close the tent now!

00:11:51.086 --> 00:11:53.213
It's freezing!

00:11:53.255 --> 00:11:55.882
Headline: "Woman Cold."

00:12:05.225 --> 00:12:08.103
(all panting)

00:12:12.441 --> 00:12:14.192
My God.

00:12:12.441 --> 00:12:14.192
I think I see the Fishmans.

00:12:14.234 --> 00:12:16.194
They're down on that ridge.

00:12:14.234 --> 00:12:16.194
We're ahead of them!

00:12:16.236 --> 00:12:17.404
Well, then

00:12:16.236 --> 00:12:17.404
let's keep moving.

00:12:17.446 --> 00:12:19.030
You guys,

00:12:17.446 --> 00:12:19.030
we can do this.

00:12:19.072 --> 00:12:21.408
We can beat them!

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.827
Hey, you know, I heard, when

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.827
you drink at high altitude,

00:12:23.868 --> 00:12:25.078
it hits you even faster.

00:12:26.288 --> 00:12:27.205
Whoo! Party!

00:12:27.247 --> 00:12:28.915
I love you guys!

00:12:28.957 --> 00:12:31.251
You don't know

00:12:28.957 --> 00:12:31.251
how much you mean to me.

00:12:31.293 --> 00:12:32.419
You think you're better than me?

00:12:32.461 --> 00:12:34.421
Why can't you hit a curveball?

00:12:34.463 --> 00:12:36.465
(sobbing):

00:12:34.463 --> 00:12:36.465
I've done nothing with my life!

00:12:47.892 --> 00:12:50.270
Hey, cats, is

00:12:47.892 --> 00:12:50.270
everybody cool?

00:12:50.312 --> 00:12:51.229
Sammy Davis Jr.?

00:12:51.271 --> 00:12:52.856
What are you doing up here?

00:12:52.897 --> 00:12:54.441
Whatever Frank tells

00:12:52.897 --> 00:12:54.441
me to do, man.

00:12:54.483 --> 00:12:57.235
Hey, Sam, get back in here

00:12:54.483 --> 00:12:57.235
and carry my golf clubs.

00:12:57.277 --> 00:12:59.070
Yas, boss!

00:12:59.112 --> 00:13:00.113
(laughs)

00:13:00.155 --> 00:13:02.240
Ew. Seems kind of racist,

00:13:00.155 --> 00:13:02.240
doesn't it?

00:13:02.282 --> 00:13:03.908
No, no, 'cause,

00:13:02.282 --> 00:13:03.908
'cause Sammy's in on it.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.536
Okay...

00:13:05.577 --> 00:13:08.872
But he's still

00:13:05.577 --> 00:13:08.872
carrying the clubs.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.461
This is so hard!

00:13:14.503 --> 00:13:16.129
I can't do

00:13:14.503 --> 00:13:16.129
this, Mom!

00:13:16.171 --> 00:13:18.089
Come on!

00:13:16.171 --> 00:13:18.089
Keep pushing, kids!

00:13:18.131 --> 00:13:19.299
We're almost there!

00:13:19.341 --> 00:13:21.259
I'm feeling nauseous.

00:13:21.301 --> 00:13:23.387
I think I got altitude sickness.

00:13:25.514 --> 00:13:27.307
Hey, Brian, you want

00:13:25.514 --> 00:13:27.307
a pukesicle?

00:13:27.349 --> 00:13:29.184
I would love a pukesicle.

00:13:32.145 --> 00:13:34.481
(gasps) I can see

00:13:32.145 --> 00:13:34.481
the top of the mountain!

00:13:34.523 --> 00:13:36.567
Let's move it!

00:14:00.215 --> 00:14:02.133
We made it!

00:14:00.215 --> 00:14:02.133
I don't believe it!

00:14:02.175 --> 00:14:04.010
We climbed Mount Everest!

00:14:04.052 --> 00:14:06.555
Isn't it amazing, Brian?

00:14:04.052 --> 00:14:06.555
You can see for...

00:14:06.597 --> 00:14:08.599
Oh, you're doing

00:14:06.597 --> 00:14:08.599
your pee thing, right.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.517
I don't really know

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.517
what the point is.

00:14:10.559 --> 00:14:13.144
I mean, there's no way

00:14:10.559 --> 00:14:13.144
other dogs can smell this.

00:14:13.186 --> 00:14:14.312
Trust me, Stewie.

00:14:13.186 --> 00:14:14.312
They'll know.

00:14:14.354 --> 00:14:17.023
They'll know

00:14:14.354 --> 00:14:17.023
the world is now mine.

00:14:17.065 --> 00:14:19.317
(sniffs)

00:14:19.359 --> 00:14:21.361
(bleep) no way.

00:14:21.403 --> 00:14:23.196
Oh, my God, you guys.

00:14:23.238 --> 00:14:25.365
I'm so proud

00:14:23.238 --> 00:14:25.365
of us all!

00:14:25.407 --> 00:14:26.366
We made it!

00:14:26.408 --> 00:14:28.952
We proved that

00:14:26.408 --> 00:14:28.952
we're not second-best!

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:32.956
ROSS:

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:32.956
Well, look

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:32.956
who finally got here.

00:14:32.997 --> 00:14:34.207
You, you beat us?

00:14:34.249 --> 00:14:35.793
Don't feel too bad, gang.

00:14:35.834 --> 00:14:38.962
We only beat you by one hour,

00:14:35.834 --> 00:14:38.962
12 minutes, and 43 seconds.

00:14:39.003 --> 00:14:41.548
And, quite frankly,

00:14:39.003 --> 00:14:41.548
we're bored of it up here.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:44.384
So you guys enjoy it.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:44.384
We're gonna head back down.

00:14:45.594 --> 00:14:47.178
I hate those guys.

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.430
Yeah, me, too.

00:14:48.472 --> 00:14:50.181
Come on.

00:14:48.472 --> 00:14:50.181
Let's head back down.

00:14:50.223 --> 00:14:52.183
At least the hard part's over.

00:14:52.225 --> 00:14:53.560
I'm not so sure

00:14:52.225 --> 00:14:53.560
about that.

00:14:53.602 --> 00:14:55.353
You might want to take a

00:14:53.602 --> 00:14:55.353
look at those storm clouds.

00:14:55.395 --> 00:14:58.398
(thunder rumbles)

00:15:03.821 --> 00:15:05.071
Oh, my God.

00:15:05.113 --> 00:15:06.824
Yeah, it looks like

00:15:05.113 --> 00:15:06.824
it's closing in fast.

00:15:06.865 --> 00:15:08.199
We're all gonna die!

00:15:08.241 --> 00:15:09.993
All right, everyone get

00:15:08.241 --> 00:15:09.993
into a hilarious pose,

00:15:10.034 --> 00:15:11.286
so when they dig out

00:15:10.034 --> 00:15:11.286
our bodies,

00:15:11.328 --> 00:15:12.621
they'll have a good laugh.

00:15:14.665 --> 00:15:17.417
Heh. This guy's

00:15:14.665 --> 00:15:17.417
pretty funny.

00:15:27.469 --> 00:15:29.053
This is terrible!

00:15:29.095 --> 00:15:31.306
The storm keeps

00:15:29.095 --> 00:15:31.306
getting worse!

00:15:31.348 --> 00:15:32.808
Mom, I can't even see!

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.435
And the scarf Brian

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.435
called "a gay waste"

00:15:35.477 --> 00:15:37.896
makes a rather

00:15:35.477 --> 00:15:37.896
important appearance.

00:15:38.021 --> 00:15:39.690
I'm so hungry.

00:15:39.731 --> 00:15:41.024
Me, too.

00:15:41.065 --> 00:15:43.276
I don't know

00:15:41.065 --> 00:15:43.276
if I can keep going.

00:15:43.318 --> 00:15:44.528
Peter, I still

00:15:43.318 --> 00:15:44.528
don't understand.

00:15:44.569 --> 00:15:47.280
How the hell can we

00:15:44.569 --> 00:15:47.280
